      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like i spent 20 years building something that just... evaporated. everything i worked for, every sacrifice, every late night. it's all just gone. i look in the mirror and i don't even recognize the person who did all that work because what was even the point? it feels like i've just wasted my entire existence for nothing.",
