    "summary": "The user expresses profound despair and nihilism after feeling that twenty years of effort have resulted in nothing. The assistant attempts to provide empathy and reframing, but eventually pivots to acknowledging the emptiness of \"positive framing\" in response to the user's rejection of resilience and growth.",
